        <summary>
          <para>Color correction processing operates at improved quality but the capture rate might be reduced (relative to sensor raw output rate)</para>
          <para>Advanced white balance adjustments above and beyond the specified white balance pipeline may be applied.</para>
          <para>If AWB is enabled with android.control.awbMode != OFF, then the camera device uses the last frame's AWB values (or defaults if AWB has never been run).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#COLOR_CORRECTION_MODE_HIGH_QUALITY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.COLOR_CORRECTION_MODE_HIGH_QUALITY</code>.</a></format></para>
